// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ADD these two fields to BOTH your CoachProfile model AND your
// ClientProfile model in schema.prisma:
//
//   featureFlags   Json?     // admin-controlled feature visibility.
//                            // null = everything visible (default,
//                            // backward-compatible with every existing
//                            // account). When set, keys map to feature
//                            // ids (see FEATURE_KEYS in
//                            // services/rbacService.js) with explicit
//                            // true/false — only false entries actually
//                            // hide something; anything unmentioned
//                            // stays visible.
//   category       String?   // free-text profile category, e.g. a coach
//                            // might be "Strength & Conditioning" or
//                            // "Nutrition Coaching"; a client might be
//                            // "Weight Loss" or "Rehab/Recovery". Purely
//                            // organizational — nothing else reads this
//                            // yet, it's a foundation for future
//                            // filtering/reporting by category.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
